# {{.DocsLabel}}

{{.ProductName}} is a command-line tool built on
[rungrad](https://github.com/vincentsch/rungrad), so it speaks the agent-ready
CLI spec: stable `--json` output, `--dry-run` previews, destructive
confirmation, deterministic results, self-describing help, and an
offline-checkable self-update.

## Build and run

```bash
go mod tidy
go build -o {{.Name}} .
./{{.Name}} widget list
./{{.Name}} widget list --json
./{{.Name}} widget create gamma --dry-run
./{{.Name}} widget delete alpha --dry-run
./{{.Name}} update --check
```

If you want to develop against a local rungrad checkout instead of the tagged
module version, add a local replace:

```bash
go mod edit -replace github.com/vincentsch/rungrad=/path/to/rungrad
go mod tidy
```

